WEBVTT

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.630
So this is Level 50...

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:22.330
My smiths and I have never made it this deep before.
You have my thanks.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.290
The pleasure is all mine.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.750
Although...

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.420
Is this how they always are?

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:46.330
They've been in a frenzy the whole journey here.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:49.170
I know this is an expedition and all,
but isn't that a bit much?

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:51.250
Well, this time's a bit of a special case.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:57.380
Miss Ais, what happened up there on the upper floors?

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:01.170
What was that Human doing...?

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:04.170
An adventure...

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:30.290
He was on an adventure.

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:57.130
If you search for the things you lack with downcast eyes

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:00.830
You'll never discover incredible places like this

00:02:02.710 --> 00:02:07.080
Let's get rid of these vague standards

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:12.130
And the courage will spread through you

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:17.670
A world without lies reflects in your eyes

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:21.880
Throw away the useless bravado and

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:26.540
Let's laugh and cry together

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:30.380
We played the strings at our own speed

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:32.580
And embellished how we wished

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:37.540
When you're around miracles can happen RE-ILLUSION

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:40.210
We shined and lit each other up

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:44.960
On the other side our dreams melded together

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:47.170
We created a synergy and

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:54.880
With our strong and genuine bond we crossed the world

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.830
Man, it was nuts!

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.540
I mean, he was going head-to-head with that Minotaur!

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:15.170
I've been itching for a fight ever since!

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:18.170
Ah, I see now. That's what this is all about.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:20.290
What was the Adventurer's name?

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:23.540
Uh, I think Ais mentioned it.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:25.880
Was it Cra Belnel?

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:28.040
Mm, I'll try to remember that.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:32.750
Seriously, though...! It was like that
Argonaut in the old stories...

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:35.960
Lefiya!

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:39.920
I wish you coulda seen the way he fought back there too!

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:41.880
Y-yeah...

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:49.630
Now, I'll announce the Party divisions
for Levels 51 and onward tomorrow.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:53.630
Myself, Riveria, Gareth.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:57.750
Ais, Bete, Tione, Tiona.

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:07.330
He was on an adventure.

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:12.380
An adventure... I feel like
he's taken the lead now, somehow.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:16.500
Even though I swore I wouldn't lose to him...

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:19.960
In addition, Raul and Lefiya will be there on support.

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.170
Yes, Sir!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:24.040
Lefiya?

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:25.580
Y-yes!

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:31.710
Tsubaki will accompany the group as our smith.

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:33.380
You got it.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:35.250
That is all.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:38.460
All right, then let's hand out the goods!

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:46.290
These are the items you ordered.
I call this series "Rolan."

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:50.330
All forged with the Durandal attribute,
like the Sword Princess' blade, Desperate.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:52.540
As such, they are unbreakable.

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:55.540
Well... It's lighter than I expected.

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:58.960
Yeah. Even something this size
should be easy enough to handle.

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:00.750
You're right! These're great!

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.130
Thank you, Tsubaki.

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:06.670
Even if we fight that new species again,
our weapons shouldn't melt now.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.460
They're just what we needed.

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:11.670
I focused on using only the most powerful materials.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:14.290
They may be light, but they are mighty.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:17.750
You didn't order another o' those
idiotic weapons o' yours?

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:22.790
She told me if I ordered an Urga,
none of the other weapons would be done in time...

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:29.000
What incredible weapons.

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:30.420
Indeed.

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:33.790
But we mages cannot depend on weapons like these.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.210
We have only devotion.

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:39.880
Yes. I'll do my best to catch up to the rest of you-

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:43.790
Catch up...

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:47.630
That's right.

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:51.580
Now isn't the time to be comparing myself
to somebody else.

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:55.920
I already have people I want to catch up to.

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:58.750
Someone I have to reach, no matter what.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.580
How could I have forgotten?

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:09.000
I'm in the middle of an adventure myself!

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.580
Let's give these weapons a test run!

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:14.170
Sure, let's do it.

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:14.750
Sword Princess!
Sure, let's do it.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:15.250
Sword Princess!

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:18.790
Your weapon's in need of some servicing, is it not?

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:21.250
If you wouldn't mind.

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.380
Still...

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:29.790
To think that little girl has become
one of the city's top ranking Adventurers.

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:32.170
Maybe I should have called dibs on you myself.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.790
Nine years it's been now...

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:38.170
You were like a drawn sword back in those days.

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:42.380
Fighting on even when your edge was worn and jagged.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:45.790
I thought you'd get yourself killed all too quickly.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:51.330
Never thought I'd be crafting a weapon
for a person like that.

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:57.000
Back then, you saw yourself
as nothing more than the sweep of a blade,

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.460
a weapon in and of itself, you see.

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:03.960
I was curious to see when you'd finally break.

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:07.040
But you changed, didn't you?

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:08.250
What?

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:10.250
Your expression's gotten gentler.

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:14.130
Though it seems people
still like to call you a doll and such.

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:17.880
Do you think I've... grown weaker?

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:21.630
Stronger, I'd say. You're already a Lv.6.

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:23.710
That's not what I mean.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:30.580
As a blade, you may have lost that sharp, pointy tip,
but I think you've found your sheath.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:31.630
My sheath?

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:34.290
Your friends, that is.

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:44.580
It just doesn't feel the same without my Urga...

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:47.040
Are you still going at it?

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:50.000
I told you to get some rest and prepare for tomorrow.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:55.540
But I just couldn't sit still! My blood's totally pumping!

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:58.420
Because of that youngster from before?

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:00.500
Yeah! He was amazing!

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:03.960
He kept on fighting, even though he knew
the enemy was way stronger than him!

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.500
And then he defeated it!

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:09.040
No matter what happens tomorrow,
what sort of enemies we face,

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:11.170
I'm gonna fight just like that boy did!

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:14.750
I'll protect Ais and Lefiya and the others!

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:17.960
I'll keep you company for now,

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:19.500
but as soon as you've had enough, it's off to bed.

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:20.830
Got it!

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:28.630
What are you staring at over there?

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:31.380
Ain't it obvious?

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:35.130
This filthy monster burrow we're all gonna raid tomorrow.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:37.330
Are you sure that's all you see?

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:44.580
Finn, put me in the vanguard tomorrow.
I'll tear everything to pieces!

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:46.920
All right then.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:50.710
Bye, Lefiya! Good luck tomorrow!

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:54.500
I'm sure you'll be fine with
Miss Ais and the others by your side.

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:56.630
I will, thank you!

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:58.000
'Night!

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.170
Good night!

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:04.130
Everyone's cheering me on.

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:05.880
I've gotta give it my all!

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:09.250
I won't let myself drag Miss Ais down this time.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:12.080
Your shoulders are too stiff, you know.

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:13.710
M-Miss Tione?!

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:16.960
Of course. We're headed
into uncharted territory, after all.

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:20.000
Telling you not to be nervous at this point
wouldn't do much anyway.

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:21.420
Right...

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:31.540
Don't worry. No matter what happens,
we'll be right there to protect you.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:34.710
And if anything happens to us...

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:38.080
I'll save you all with my magic.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:43.880
All right, off to bed then?

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:47.830
Tiona always makes too much noise talking in her sleep.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:50.630
Want to sneak into the Boss' tent instead?

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:53.880
A nice Boss-sized body pillow sounds pretty wonderful!

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:55.880
You know, I don't think...

00:09:57.750 --> 00:10:00.540
M-Miss Tione, wai-!

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:04.630
So-some blankets! I'll get us some blankets!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:16.460
Thank you. I'll do my best tomorrow.

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.170
Veil Breath!

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:39.460
I've cast some protective magic.

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:43.500
The effects should last a while,
but don't get too overconfident.

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:46.130
We'll charge through Level 51 as quickly as possible.

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:47.670
Don't worry about the small fry.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.540
Approach any of those new monsters with caution.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.250
Everyone, prepare for battle!

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:57.130
Go now, Bete! Tiona!

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:12.630
Come on, Bete!

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:18.960
We really tore right through, didn't we?

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:22.750
They're even more berserk than I anticipated.

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:26.420
Bete and Tiona are even wilder than usual...

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:30.500
Don't expect to be able to resupply
from Level 52 onwards.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:31.540
Why not?

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.170
They'll fire at you the moment you stop moving.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.630
Fire at us?

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:39.130
From here on out... it's hell below us.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.500
Hell?

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:41.880
Let's move!

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:55.500
Finn, what do you think'll be firing at us?
I don't sense anything around us...

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:58.170
They've already got us in their trap.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:02.580
Wh-what's that sound?

00:12:03.630 --> 00:12:04.330
They're coming.

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:05.830
Bete, dodge!

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:10.210
Let's skirt around to the west!

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:18.580
Now I see what you meant by firing at us!

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:19.920
Raul, look out!

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:22.210
Raul!

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:26.000
Lefiya!

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:34.330
Lefiya!

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:42.460
I'm bypassing the levels!

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:45.420
Is this hell?!

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.500
You bastards!

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:54.420
Miss Tiona!

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:57.920
Damn, that's hot!

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:01.210
Thank the gods for Riveria's magic!

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:03.920
What're you doin', you dunce?!

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:05.750
Lefiya, you all right?!

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:06.670
You guys!

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:10.040
We'll free-fall all the way down to Level 58
and then deal with these jerks!

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:11.670
Lefiya, your incantation!

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:12.500
R-right!

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:16.630
Proud warriors. Archers of the forest.

00:13:16.630 --> 00:13:17.750
Take up your-

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:23.670
You damn pests are going down!

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:29.210
Don't go, Ais!

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:32.330
Tsubaki and Raul are still here with us.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:35.380
We'll take the main route and head down to Level 58.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:40.750
There'll be a Party waiting for you when you get there.

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:53.500
I've got this!

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:58.040
We're comin' for ya, ya shitheads!

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:01.250
They're all yours, Lefiya!

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:03.710
Fusillade Fallarica!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:21.000
I... I thought I was a goner...

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:24.250
With all that magic up your sleeve? Come on, now.

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:29.040
You burned all those Valgang Dragons, Ill Wyverns,
and those new species to a crisp!

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:36.080
Th-that's a lil' bigger...

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:38.670
I'm sure that isn't the Floor Boss, but still...

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:44.540
Oh shit-

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:50.790
That was close!

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:52.130
I'll use my magic to-

00:14:52.130 --> 00:14:53.500
Outta the way!

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:54.460
Gramps?!

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:55.290
Gareth?!

00:14:57.880 --> 00:14:58.880
Mr. Gareth!

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:02.670
A puny flame like this- don't make me laugh!

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.630
Are you young'ns all okay?

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:11.170
Mr. Gareth!

00:15:11.830 --> 00:15:13.540
That was one hell of an entry, Gramps...

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:15.960
That's a Lvl.6 for you.

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:21.330
Good grief, looks like they're not gonna
give us a break, are they?

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:26.380
Come on, let's get these taken care of
before Finn and the others get here!

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:27.920
You don't have to tell me twice!

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:29.000
Already on it!

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:36.000
What are you doing?

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:41.750
The Sword Princess has already made it
to the deeper levels.

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:43.920
Why do you remain?

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:49.210
You should know this already,
but my body's fuel consumption is abysmal.

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:54.920
Besides, in my current state
I've yet to surpass Aria in strength.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:57.330
Making a move now would be pointless.

00:15:57.580 --> 00:16:00.960
You think only of yourself. If any problems arise-

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:02.670
They're strong.

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:05.920
I have no doubt they'll make it to Level 59.

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:07.960
Worse comes to worst,

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:10.380
I'll take Aria's corpse.

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:13.630
You intend to defy Enyo?

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:16.540
I don't care if you use me.

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:19.250
But in exchange, I'll do as I damn well please.

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:22.710
Why don't you act on your own for once?
Tell Her I said that.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.250
Arcs Ray!

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:36.500
Let them scavenge each other!

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:39.750
Remember, the new species are drawn to magic!
You need to fall back!

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:41.210
R-right!

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:44.580
The Caterpillars are moving steadily southward...

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:46.000
What does it mean?!

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:48.580
There's an access way to the south!

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:51.880
They must be heading towards even deeper levels!

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:55.500
No way... They're going to Level 59 just like us?!

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.960
We don't know that for sure, but...

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:04.500
M-more of them?!

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.000
These dirtbags don't know when to give up!

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:08.580
Wynn Fimbulvetr!

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:19.790
Miss Ais!

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:22.830
Riveria! And-

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:24.420
Boss!

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:26.960
Is everyone all right?

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:28.380
More or less.

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:31.420
Oh, a Flame Dragon's tooth!

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:35.080
And a Flame Dragon's scale!

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:36.830
I've got to take these back with me!

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:41.670
Sorry, but you'll have to grab them
on the way back. We can't carry them now.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:44.420
I suppose you're right.

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:46.670
Let's take a quick breather.

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:49.380
Tsubaki, I need you to repair everyone's weapons.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:51.460
Right, leave it to me!

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:00.080
I'm so sorry about before!

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:04.960
It's all right, things turned out fine!
I'm just glad you were okay!

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:06.130
No, no, really!

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:07.420
Yes, yes, really!

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:08.710
No, no, no, really!

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:10.380
Yes, yes, yes, really!

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:15.210
Though we had to split the Party unexpectedly,

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:19.790
we somehow managed to clear Level 58,
where we've had to retreat before.

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:22.920
Not like it was our first run. Piece o' cake.

00:18:22.920 --> 00:18:25.500
That's not what it sounded like a minute ago.

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:27.000
Look who's talkin'!

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:29.460
Nope, I heard you huffing and puffing too.

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.500
Shut up, ya senile old man!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.540
Who're you calling senile?!

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:36.380
Is something wrong, Boss?

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:45.460
According to records taken by the Zeus Familia,
Level 59 is the beginning of an icy, glacial area.

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:46.580
That's right.

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:50.830
There's a stream running off a glacial lake,
making it difficult to traverse,

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:54.210
and the bitter cold will make traveling on foot very slow.

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:58.170
I heard that as well, so I prepared
Salamander Wool for each of us to wear.

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:01.580
But then why...

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:05.130
Why can't we feel the cold where we are now?

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.130
You think somethin's up?

00:19:10.130 --> 00:19:15.330
I'm not sure, but the Zeus Familia's account
couldn't have been a mere exaggeration.

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:23.540
Aria, go to Level 59.

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:26.750
There, you should find the answer to what you seek.

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:35.460
Let's head out without the Salamander Wool.

00:19:35.460 --> 00:19:37.830
Everyone, we leave in three minutes.

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:47.040
Soon, the Loki Familia will set foot on Level 59.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.290
The time has come, then.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:52.630
Allow me to show you.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:55.710
Well, it's definitely not cold...

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:58.130
It feels humid.

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:01.920
Finn, I think this is it...

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:03.130
Indeed.

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:09.330
What we're about to see is a place
only the gods have witnessed until now...

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:11.670
The Unknown.

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:22.920
A jungle...?

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:26.880
It almost seems like the Plants back on Level 24...

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:29.750
One and the same, looks like.

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:36.500
Keep moving.

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:03.750
What is that?

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:08.330
That monster's been evolved
by one of those orbs too, hasn't it?!

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:14.000
The parasite's attached itself to...
the Corpse Flower, Titan Arum.

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:18.040
That ain't good...

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:19.880
So many Magic Stones...

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:21.630
It's evolved...

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:49.170
Wh-what is it doing?!

00:21:49.710 --> 00:21:51.880
No way... It's...

00:21:55.330 --> 00:21:56.330
Aria!

00:21:57.920 --> 00:21:59.790
A Spirit...

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:10.500
Good morning, open up the window and

00:22:10.500 --> 00:22:13.960
You can go anywhere

00:22:13.960 --> 00:22:17.830
A wish you whipser to yourself each day

00:22:17.830 --> 00:22:21.830
To keep moving forward as far as you can

00:22:21.960 --> 00:22:28.580
You compare yourself to others, let out a sigh

00:22:28.580 --> 00:22:34.960
I know, I know

00:22:36.460 --> 00:22:43.500
Kindness, warmth

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:47.210
One day the two of you

00:22:47.330 --> 00:22:53.920
Will surely know what it is to love

00:22:53.920 --> 00:23:01.000
The you of tomorrow will turn the you of today

00:23:01.250 --> 00:23:04.580
Into memories and

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:08.790
Move forwards past them

00:23:08.960 --> 00:23:15.880
The rain will stop, you'll lift your chin up and

00:23:15.880 --> 00:23:21.790
You'll be able to say "Thank you" with an honest smile

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:25.250
Hello, hello, hello

00:23:25.460 --> 00:23:34.040
Sing your love for someone

00:23:37.880 --> 00:23:39.290
"Sword Oratoria"
